<!--
  AppStream metadata for the yacr Flatpak. The app-id must match the manifest.
  This is not a Flathub submission; it exists so desktop software centres show a
  real name/summary/icon and so `flatpak-builder` has consistent metadata.
-->
<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.zenglanmu.yacr</id>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>AGPL-3.0</project_license>
  <name>Yacr</name>
  <summary>Cross-platform open-source CAD for DWG/DXF drawings</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="zh-CN">面向 DWG/DXF 图纸的跨平台开源 CAD</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Yacr is a cross-platform open-source CAD project. A shared Rust core
      handles DWG/DXF documents, geometry and rendering; React + Tauri provides
      the desktop UI. It opens local DWG/DXF drawings and shows model space and
      supported layouts, and it draws and edits 2D geometry through the same
      database transaction and undo path. A document-level application domain
      (2D drafting, BIM, concept modelling or mechanical) selects the interface
      chrome while the same Rust core keeps the document. Linux/Wayland is the primary development target with
      the strongest support; the Android APK has been sideloaded by the
      maintainer, and the Windows/macOS hosts are real but their runtime
      acceptance is still pending.
    </p>
    <p xml:lang="zh-CN">
      Yacr 是一个跨平台开源 CAD 项目：共享的 Rust 核心负责 DWG/DXF 文档、几何与渲染，
      React + Tauri 提供桌面界面。它可打开本地 DWG/DXF 图纸，查看模型空间与受支持的布局，
      并可通过同一数据库写事务与撤销历史绘制、编辑 2D 几何。文档级的应用域（二维绘图、
      建筑信息模型、概念建模或机械设计）决定界面表现，文档数据仍由同一个 Rust 核心持有。
      Linux/Wayland 是主开发目标，支持最完整；Android APK 已由维护者侧载运行；Windows/macOS 是真实宿主，运行时验收仍待补。
    </p>
  </description>
